WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.675
Made it. Missed it. One tap.

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:07.638
When you make the lift, tap Made. The next set loads and your rest starts.

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:13.069
Rate the effort, six easy to ten all out. Nine or ten holds your weight.

00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:18.641
If you miss, tap Miss. Tag what went wrong, or dismiss it.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:23.094
Download Barforge Weightlifting. No account. Free to start.
